Cell["\<\
OBS! After \[Gamma] ~= 0.38, the equilibrium with pA = pB is no longer stable \
(eigenvalue of LD is positive) and a split occurs . See the phase diagram \
with the same values to see behaviour . This disappears with higher \
migration, but the boundaries set here are given by the low migration limit.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9194785588889713`*^9, 
  3.9194786123348217`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bb65d539-a15d-4548-854e-\
c02380b8282e"],

